  "title": "Market town",
  "description": "Brief: a toy market town with a railway round it. A block of eleven town houses back to back between two streets, each in its own colours: shop houses with arched windows and striped awnings, tall houses with street gables and bay windows, corner houses with roof terraces and water towers, hotels with balconies; a town hall with a portico and a clock tower in the middle of the high street. Roads with dashed centre lines and parked cars, pavements with lamp posts, trees and benches, a park with a pond and a bandstand at one end and a fountain square at the other; a station platform with a shelter on the front straight of an oval of official train track, and a train of a locomotive and a coach.",
